x690/uPMIOK260nmNw5jP.mp4"}, "poll": false, "user": {"profilePicture": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/619546088995979264/KuG27bBK_normal.jpg", "displayName": "Breaking911", "username": "Breaking911"}, "content": "A Rolex store was looted in Marseille, France amid the violent protests.", "parentTweet": false, "likes": 278}}, "post_flair_text": "", "archive_id": ""}, {"is_locked": false, "tweet_id": "", "sticky_comment": 0, "is_video_mp4": false, "type": "text", "uuid": "1ATVjYVFPa", "is_twitter": false, "is_admin": false, "score": 399, "suggested_sort": 0, "post_flair_class": "", "id": 8890456, "raw_content": "had traffic court yesterday and finally saw first hand how bad it really is with illegals. An illegal was brought out from lock up to make his plea for a misdemeanor reckless driving. The commonwealth and his attorney both tried dancing around why he was locked up for a misdemeanor reckless driving charge with the judge pushing for information on why he was arrested and why the first judge refused him being released.  He was involved in an incident that resulted in a death while driving recklessly which is a felony charge however the commonwealth attorney has decided to give him a reckless driving charge to avoid him getting deported. This incident happened in july of which only two fatal crashes happened. one where a local disabled man was hit on his mobility scooter and the second where a motorcyclist was kidded after being hit getting off the highway. \n\neither way if a death occurs it\u2019s a felony charge and usually manslaughter added on but for some reason if your illegal it\u2019s less than one year in prison if convicted. maybe it is time for bullets to fly.", "author": "2021is1776-2", "created": 1792233597815, "profile_picture": "", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "fskfsk", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "", "removal_source": "", "link": "", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [], "blurhash": "", "full_resolution": []}, "title": "first hand experience with the VA unjustice system ", "last_comment_created": 1792281624756, "content": "<p>had traffic court yesterday and finally saw first hand how bad it really is with illegals. An illegal was brought out from lock up to make his plea for a misdemeanor reckless driving. The commonwealth and his attorney both tried dancing around why he was locked up for a misdemeanor reckless driving charge with the judge pushing for information on why he was arrested and why the first judge refused him being released.  He was involved in an incident that resulted in a death while driving recklessly which is a felony charge however the commonwealth attorney has decided to give him a reckless driving charge to avoid him getting deported. This incident happened in july of which only two fatal crashes happened. one where a local disabled man was hit on his mobility scooter and the second where a motorcyclist was kidded after being hit getting off the highway.</p>\n<p>either way if a death occurs it\u2019s a felony charge and usually manslaughter added on but for some reason if your illegal it\u2019s less than one year in prison if convicted. maybe it is time for bullets to fly.</p>\n", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 0, "is_stickied": false, "is_nsfw": false, "is_deleted": false, "is_image": false, "comments": 34, "score_up": 399, "is_edited": false, "is_moderator": false, "awards": 0, "vote_state": 2, "link_metadata": {"status": 200}, "post_flair_text": "", "archive_id": ""}, {"is_locked": false, "tweet_id": "", "sticky_comment": 0, "is_video_mp4": false, "type": "link", "uuid": "1ATVjZdMYB", "is_twitter": false, "is_admin": false, "score": 49, "suggested_sort": 0, "post_flair_class": "", "id": 8891307, "raw_content": "", "author": "PiratePatriotParrot", "created": 1792274555058, "profile_picture": "", "co